# Search ignore list (ripgrep / fd, gitignore syntax): generated, vendored and lock files that agents' searches skip,
# so a search lands on the source of truth. Self-written source never goes here. Search them anyway with rg --no-ignore-dot.
# Workspace baseline (agentteam-deployments docs/reference/REPO-BASELINE.md).

# Lock files
Cargo.lock
package-lock.json

# Copy of Cloud's error catalog (source of truth: agentrouter-cloud; its "source" field names the commit)
crates/device-core/src/error-catalog.json

# Lock fixtures of the aggregator tests
crates/aggregator/tests/fixtures/locks/

# Copy of AgentCompute's executor protocol contract (source of truth: agentrouter-top/AgentCompute; SOURCE.json names the ref)
vendor/agentcompute/
